A '''city''' existed<ref name="AGoodTurn" /> on the [[planet]] [[Duro]]<ref name="DurounderworldID" /> during the later [[Republic Era]]. The city was crime ridden. The [[Duros]] criminal and bounty hunter [[Cad Bane]] grew up as an orphan on the streets of the city together with his friend [[Niro]].<ref name="TheGoodLife" /> The city was governed by a [[Unidentified town council|town council]] and had a [[Unidentified police force|police force]].<ref name="OneGoodDeed" />

